   xwnv:Features="Front Row Left to Right: Silverado 2500HD Custom Crew Cab Standard Box in Silver Ice Metallic (GAN) ,  Silverado 1500 Double Cab WT Standard Box  in Summit White (GAZ) with accessory tool box,  Silverado 6500HD Regular Cab LT 2WD in Red Hot (G7C) shown with third party dump bed upfit, Colorado 4x4 WT in Summit White (GAZ) with third party ladder rack accessory.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Back Row Left to Right:  Express 3500 Extended wheelbase Cargo Van in Summit White (GAZ) with aftermarket accessories, Express 3500 Cutaway in Summit White (GAZ) with third party Service Body upfit, Silverado 3500HD Chassis Cab WT with after market utility body in Summit White (GAZ), LCF 4500 in Arc White (16U) with third party Stake Body upfit, Silverado 3500HD DRW LT in Black (GBA) with fifth-wheel/Goose neck package."
